{
 "about": "World still items the stills sweep (lane SPRITES, 2026-10-29) found drawn at 1.5+ need/available at 3 device px per world px, each from its own CC0 SWF in glitch-items: the Visiting Stone, notes, gift boxes, notice boards and the left mailbox (features/street-furniture-feature.js), the home furniture base pieces (furniture/furniture_base and bag_furniture_cabinet_base, js/home-decor.js), the street-job sign stake, the Party ATM, the Rook Hall speaker and the Butler's box (js/butler.js BUTLER_BOX_ART); G446: Hell's Bunch of Grapes on the floor (js/hell.js, four states) and Señor Funpickle's still (features/funpickle-feature.js). SHARP3 (2026-10-30, Original zoom draws the street at about 2.9 backing px per world px on a 1440 px Retina window): the Race Ticket Dispenser (features/races-feature.js); the back yard's Meat Collector, Butterfly Milker and Piggy Feeder (their filled frame 2) and plops (features/animal-husbandry-feature.js); the home street's Pile of Currants (features/home-street-mp-feature.js) and Firefly Hive (features/homes-feature.js POD_ART); Wine of the Dead (labels 1-4, frames 92-95) and the Drink Ticket on the floor (js/hell.js); the Graveside Marker of each Giant (graveside_marker.swf, each Giant's own named sprite: DefineSprite 8 giantZille ... 41 giantGeneric; the emblem is too small for the score to tell Giants apart, the named sprite scores best for every one); Pig Bait (Hog Haul); Shim Shiri's light beams (puzzles-feature.js, drawn at 2.2); the Rook Egg (Rooks' Woods, labels 5-1). Root-timeline items render from a copy with a padded stage (padStage). Run: node tools/vector-sprites/build.mjs --manifest tools/vector-sprites/stills.json SHARP batch 2 (2026-11-02, homes): the Door in each of its four states (furniture_base/furniture_door.swf; the placed door_up article swapped for door_up_job / door_down / door_down_job, its config_options; furniture_door.png is the OGA's door_up_job) and the three Magic Animal Sticks as placed in the back yard (scene placed, frame 3).",
